&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;After 30 Days: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve developed a solid understanding of our current perception architecture, sensor suite (lidar, camera, IMU, GPS), and calibration and fusion pipeline. You&#39;ve reviewed the state estimation and tracking algorithms end-to-end and identified concrete opportunities to improve accuracy, robustness, or performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
